    "Each photo is resized to the device's camera resolution and re-encoded; small photos may look blurry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每张照片都会调整为该机型相机的分辨率并重新编码，较小的照片放大后可能模糊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
