        }
      }
    },
    "Fills in make, model, lens, aperture and focal length. Estimated lenses are based on published specs because no original sample was available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动填写品牌、型号、镜头、光圈和焦距。标为“估算”的镜头暂无真机样片，按官方规格推算。"
