    "Live Photo: the video is saved too, and its date, location and device are updated to match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片：视频会一起保存，拍摄时间、地点和机型也会同步到视频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Photos are marked in the grid": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片在网格中有标记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Photos keep their video": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片会保留视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Photos keep their video, and its date, location and device are updated to match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片会保留视频，并同步视频中的拍摄时间、地点和机型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Photos need the pairing ID stored in MakerNote, so MakerNote is kept for this lossless save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片的配对信息存在 MakerNote 中，无损保存时 MakerNote 会被保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
